Auras.lua
# The raid marker, right of the bar
Marks.lua
# Your combo points on the power line of your target's bar
Resource.lua
# Plates smaller far away
Scale.lua
# Our dress on each plate the game shows, laid over its health bar; the game's own bar, name, auras and marks out of sight under it
Plate.lua
